From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:06:20 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 316/333] [ae-patch] Speak replies menu with tooltips, and
 natural cloud voices

The Speak replies menu is now six one-line rows: Speak replies and Fast
answers are switch rows, their helper text sits behind the small "i", and
Voice and Speed are matching sub-menus. The "best here" tag is gone.

Voice now lists the server's natural voices (Azure Speech, through
POST /v1/ae/tts) above this device's voices. A cloud speaker plays one mp3
per sentence in order, fetching the next while one plays, and reads any
sentence the server cannot make through the device voice so an outage still
speaks. The stored voice is cloud:<id> or device:<voiceURI>; an older bare
value reads as a device voice.

Dated 2026-11-09.
